---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="introduction" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <h1 id="intro-title">Hi, I’m {{ site.name }}.</h1>
  <p>I study AI safety, especially mechanistic interpretability.<br class="desktop-break"> I’m also learning backend development and building things along the way.</p>
  <p class="intro-note">This is where I share what I’m learning.</p>
  <a class="intro-about" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">More about me <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h12m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></a>
</section>
<section class="writing" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
<div class="section-heading"><h2 id="writing-title">Latest writing</h2><span>Notes & essays</span></div>
<div id="filter-status" hidden><span></span><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">All posts</a></div>
<ul class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.posts %}
  <li data-categories="{{ post.data.categories | json | escape }}">
    <h3><a class="post-title" href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    {% if post.data.description %}<p class="post-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="card-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dateLabel }}</time><span class="post-category">{{ post.data.categories[0] }}</span>{% if post.data.demo %}<span class="demo-marker">Sample</span>{% endif %}</div>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
<div id="empty-posts" {% if collections.posts.length %}hidden{% endif %}><h3>The first page is still unwritten.</h3><p>No posts yet. New writing will appear here.</p></div>
<noscript><p>Browse all posts above. Enable JavaScript to filter by category or search.</p></noscript>
</section>
